== Small Appliances

Small appliances take up a lot of room. Give each one a simple decision. Write down the last time you used it and choose.

#v(0.15in)
#_wk-table(
  (1fr, 1.5in, 3.4em, 3.6em, 3.4em, 3.4em),
  ([Appliance], [Last time I used it], [Keep], [Donate], [Sell], [Toss]),
  (),
  extra: 9, y: 12pt,
)

#v(0.15in)
Before you donate or sell an appliance, unplug it, wipe it down and check that it works. Include the cord, and any parts that belong with it. Something that doesn't work, or that is missing parts, goes in Toss. Check your local guidelines for electronics disposal.

